---
import '../../scripts/vendor/anatomy/iso.css'
import '../styles/anatomy.css'
import { rfpSandboxHeroSvg } from '../lib/rfp-sandbox-hero.mjs'
---

<figure class="decision-hero iso rfp-sandbox-hero">
  <div class="decision-hero-inner">
    <div class="decision-hero-copy">
      <pre class="decision-hero-code"><code><span class="c">CLAIM: MFA enforced</span>
CHECK: 11 / 12
<span class="r">RESULT: CONTRADICTED</span>

<span class="g">supported</span> · stale · unknown</code></pre>
      <p class="decision-hero-line">
        An answer is more useful when the evidence can disagree with it.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-hero-art" set:html={rfpSandboxHeroSvg} />
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Illustrative flow; MFA and audit observations are synthetic. Geometry built
    with <a href="https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy">Anatomy</a>, an
    MIT-licensed isometric illustration toolkit.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .rfp-sandbox-label[data-tone='green'] text { fill: var(--anatomy-green); }
  .rfp-sandbox-label[data-tone='red'] text { fill: var(--anatomy-red); }
  .rfp-sandbox-label[data-tone='blue'] text { fill: var(--anatomy-blue); }
  .rfp-sandbox-label[data-tone='mid'] text { fill: var(--anatomy-mid); }
</style>
